CLI.md §2.2, DECISIONS 143: a/b without ./ is a package name; an unknown one is named as typed.
-- dir --
game
-- args --
check
./items
items/sub
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
}
-- game/items/items.canon --
package game.items
-- want --
[exit 2]
[stdout]
[stderr]
canon: unknown package: items/sub
